# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Generated artifacts — COMMITTED on purpose.
#
# The pipeline regenerates everything deterministically (seed 42), and both
# deployed apps can bootstrap from a clean checkout. They are still committed
# because Streamlit Community Cloud's free containers are slow and sleep after
# ~12h idle: a cold visitor would otherwise wait minutes while the full
# pipeline (random forests + SHAP + KMeans) re-runs on a shared CPU, and
# recruiters judge the project in under a minute (PRD user story 1).
#
# The weight is small now that model pickles are compressed at joblib level 3
# (clv_model.pkl ~49 MB -> ~11 MB; all artifacts ~14 MB combined).
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Raw dataset — deliberately COMMITTED. PRD.md Section 7 requires "pipeline
# runs top-to-bottom with zero errors on a clean checkout", and the pipeline
# reads this file to regenerate every artifact.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
data/raw/*
!data/raw/.gitkeep
!data/raw/telecom_customer_churn.csv

# Stray root-level copies of the raw data — the canonical copy lives at
# data/raw/telecom_customer_churn.csv; these Desktop leftovers are not part
# of the repo.
/telecom_customer_churn.csv
/telecom_data_dictionary.csv
/telecom_zipcode_population.csv

# orchestrator runtime state
orchestrator/runtime/

# python
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.venv/

# scratch & cache
.commandcode/
.pytest_cache/
scratch_*
*.log